      "description": "PR #362 added kspec validate --drift, a user-facing CLI flag for AC schema field validation. This was shipped without a spec item or formal ACs, violating the spec-before-code rule. Create a spec item with acceptance criteria covering: field detection from prose, conceptual vs schema fields, strict mode, exit codes, and false positive handling.",
